{"meta":{"ui":"order_summary","model":"claude-haiku-5-5","form":"notation","designSystem":"cards","turn":"generate","prompt":"Show my grocery order as an inline card before you place it, with the number of items at the top. Five lines, each with a picture placeholder, its price and a quantity I can raise or lower (removing the line at zero): Bananas 1 kg $2.50 x1, Whole milk 2 L $3.20 x2, Sourdough loaf $4.50 x1, Free-range eggs $5.00 x1, Cheddar $7.00 x1. A promo code field where SAVE10 takes 10% off the subtotal, delivery of $4.99, and the subtotal, promo and total kept up to date as I change things. Confirm and cancel buttons that tell you what I decided.","text":"ChatCard \"Your grocery order\" \"5 items\" icon:\"shopping_cart\" status:\"Review\" tone:accent\n  state lines=[{\"id\":1,\"name\":\"Bananas\",\"detail\":\"1 kg\",\"price\":2.5,\"qty\":1},{\"id\":2,\"name\":\"Whole milk\",\"detail\":\"2 L\",\"price\":3.2,\"qty\":2},{\"id\":3,\"name\":\"Sourdough loaf\",\"detail\":\"Bakery\",\"price\":4.5,\"qty\":1},{\"id\":4,\"name\":\"Free-range eggs\",\"detail\":\"Dozen\",\"price\":5.0,\"qty\":1},{\"id\":5,\"name\":\"Cheddar\",\"detail\":\"400 g\",\"price\":7.0,\"qty\":1}]\n  state promo=\"\"\n  state decision=\"\"\n  let items = sum(map(lines, l => l.qty))\n  let subtotal = sum(map(lines, l => l.qty * l.price))\n  let discount = promo == \"SAVE10\" ? subtotal * 0.1 : 0\n  let delivery = 4.99\n  let total = subtotal - discount + delivery\n  SectionLabel \"Items\" \"{items} items\"\n  each l in lines\n    Row gap:12 between\n      Media kind:\"banana\" h:44 w:44\n      Column gap:2 grow\n        Text.rowTitle \"{l.name}\"\n        Text.muted \"{l.detail}\"\n      Text.strong \"{money(l.price,\"$\",2)}\"\n      Row gap:6\n        IconButton \"remove\" -> l.qty -= 1; if (l.qty <= 0) { lines.remove(l) }\n        Text.strong \"x{l.qty}\"\n        IconButton \"add\" -> l.qty += 1\n  Input \"Promo code\" \"Enter code\" =promo\n  Details rows:[[\"Subtotal\",\"{money(subtotal,\"$\",2)}\"],[\"Promo SAVE10\",\"{discount > 0 ? \"-\" + money(discount,\"$\",2) : \"\"}\"],[\"Delivery\",\"{money(delivery,\"$\",2)}\"]]\n  TotalBar \"Total\" \"{items} items\" amount:\"{money(total,\"$\",2)}\" cta:\"Confirm\" icon:\"check\" -> decision=\"confirmed\"\n  Row gap:10\n    ActionButton \"Cancel\" quiet -> decision=\"cancelled\"\n    ActionButton \"Confirm\" primary -> decision=\"confirmed\"\n  if decision == \"confirmed\"\n    Receipt \"Order placed\" \"Your groceries are on the way.\" tone:good icon:\"check\"\n  if decision == \"cancelled\"\n    Receipt \"Order cancelled\" \"Nothing was charged.\" tone:neutral icon:\"close\"","usage":{"input_tokens":9488,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":878,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard","output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0}},"ttftMs":590,"totalMs":3463}}
